---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const page = {
  "title": "Cookies — Ey-aye",
  "description": "This site sets no cookies of its own and runs no trackers. Here is what does load, and why there is no banner.",
  "path": "/cookies/"
};
---
<Base {...page}>
<section class="wrap legal">
<h1>Cookies</h1>
<p class="updated">Last updated 6 November 2026</p>
<p>This site does not set cookies of its own, and it does not run advertising trackers. We do count visits that arrive on a tagged link (which link, which page, which country), but that's done on our server without cookies or browser storage. That's why there's no cookie banner.</p>
<h2>What does load</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Fonts</strong> from Google Fonts. Your browser requests the font files from Google, which sees your IP address in the process. No cookie is set.</li>
<li><strong>The booking calendar</strong>, when it's embedded on the Book section, is provided by a third party and may set its own cookies to work. Its cookie policy applies within that box.</li>
<li><strong>Hosting</strong> by Cloudflare may set a strictly necessary security cookie in some circumstances, for example to tell apart real visitors from automated traffic.</li>
</ul>
<p>If we ever add anything that sets cookies or tracks you for advertising, this page will change and the site will ask for your consent first.</p>
</section>
</Base>
